_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/edli0x/it_s_time_talk_about_tees"},{"short_id":"1kesjm","created_at":"2026-10-17T13:25:58.714-05:00","title":"Abolish AI! Manifesto","url":"https://abolish-ai.net/abolish-ai-a-manifesto/","score":6,"flags":10,"comment_count":12,"description":"","description_plain":"","submitter_user":"janus","user_is_author":false,"tags":["vibecoding"],"short_id_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/1kesjm","comments_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/1kesjm/abolish_ai_manifesto"},{"short_id":"yodyg9","created_at":"2026-10-17T13:25:43.530-05:00","title":"poddub, make something worth listening to","url":"https://poddub.com","score":-5,"flags":6,"comment_count":0,"description":"\u003cp\u003eWhat it is:\nShort podcast episodes created from your company documents.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUse cases:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRelease notes: Let your team hear what the company shipped.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCustomers: Let customers follow your updates as a public show.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eProduct: Share customer feedback with the people building it.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAgents: Have your agent send its summaries over MCP.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n","description_plain":"What it is:\r\nShort podcast episodes created from your company documents.\r\n\r\nUse cases:\r\n- Release notes: Let your team hear what the company shipped.\r\n- Customers: Let customers follow your updates as a public show.\r\n- Product: Share customer feedback with the people building it.\r\n- Agents: Have your agent send its summaries over MCP.","submitter_user":"gesposito","user_is_author":true,"tags":["mobile","show","web"],"short_id_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/yodyg9","comments_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/yodyg9/poddub_make_something_worth_listening"},{"short_id":"np84oh","created_at":"2026-10-17T13:24:39.593-05:00","title":"PwnEscape: Guest-to-Host KVM Escape (CVE-2026-99999)","url":"https://pwn.ai/blog/pwnescape","score":10,"flags":0,"comment_count":5,"desc